        "# sorted\n",
        "\n",
        "Return a new sorted list from an iterable.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Signature:** `sorted(iterable, /, *, key=None, reverse=False)`\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "id": "4c68240f06154e7a",
      "metadata": {
      },
      "source": [
        "sorted(['bbb', 'a'], key=len)  # ['a', 'bbb']\n"
      ],
